title: "ColPali Reproduction with Triton MaxSim"
abstract: >-
  A scoped, reproducible ColPali document-retrieval study with tested PyTorch
  references, real ViDoRe subset results, and a custom tiled Triton MaxSim
  kernel validated, tuned, and profiled on an NVIDIA L4.
